<title>USA: RYKA Inc engages new accounting firm.</title>
<headline>RYKA Inc engages new accounting firm.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>RYKA Inc said Wednesday that it appointed Deloitte &amp; Touche as its independent accountant to succeed Margolis &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The decision was made in connection with the company's need to restate its third quarter earnings, said Janet Rosowicz, a spokeswoman for the company's investor relations department.</p>
<p>In November the company reported net income for the third quarter of $112,753. The restated net income for the quarter is $33,587, Rosowicz said.</p>
</text>
